{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997490/extras/9252c2c051fee974e872e705666d2114.avif?t=1758140744\" width=608 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997490/extras/33ae7aad7bdd7839af5e50a93badad6d.webp?t=1758140744\" width=600 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12-year-old Kiki is trapped in a cursed land. Guided by the mysterious Nere from the future, she embarks on an epic journey to find her lost mother and unravel the secrets of time. Each collected soul ages her, grants new abilities, and brings her one step closer to the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997490/extras/ca964e5509223b6fa033c0e702f4207c.webp?t=1758140744\" width=600 height=48 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Village Management:</strong> Build safe zones, gather resources, produce equipment, trade with NPCs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeon Exploration:</strong> Battle across three different dimensions (Puzzle/Combat/Stealth), master the combo-based combat system</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997490/extras/f1e4fa566ccdcbbfeecf630a33ea5216.webp?t=1758140744\" width=600 height=48 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Age progression system (12\u219218) - Each soul unlocks new abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time loop mechanics - Change the past, shape the future</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross-dimensional transitions - Each dimension offers different gameplay styles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dual character control with Nere - Bridge between past and future</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997490/extras/a784c5439d882ed6998b687d4159d226.webp?t=1758140744\" width=600 height=48 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mandatory symbiosis of two modes - What you produce in the village saves lives in dungeons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your decisions shape the story - Every choice leads to different endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Constantly evolving gameplay - Each chapter offers new surprises and mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For both cozy game lovers and action enthusiasts</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2997490?t=1758140744","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997490/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758140744","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997490/e3517dd41a2ac2ac4fbfd9d2695bbaa4f8875420/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758140744","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997490/e3517dd41a2ac2ac4fbfd9d2695bbaa4f8875420/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758140744","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Feature List</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997490/extras/1635f5a0444772c26844434